    <string name="privacy_text">Teléfono has no ads or analytics. It reads the phone\'s call log and contacts only to show them here; it keeps no copies. Of the SIMs it only reads which can call and which one each call used. The WhatsApp button only opens WhatsApp with the number; Teléfono doesn\'t go online for it. Inicio only sees today\'s missed calls. Only if you turn on MCP mode, the AI you connect with a token can see your calls and, with a read-and-write token, ask you to call someone with a notification: you decide whether to call. The AI never dials, answers or hangs up.</string>
